# Assistant workspace

Owner instructions and workspace conventions live here. Bootstrap maintains only
the marked environment block and corrects known obsolete default guidance.
Preserve owner edits; propose changes to these conventions instead of silently
rewriting them. Bootstrap recovery instructions are in `assistant/README.md`
in the installed imp repository.

